    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-30T21:18:07+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-30T21:18:07+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T10:48:07Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-30T10:48:07Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A ridge of high pressure lies over eastern parts of SA. A low pressure system south of the Bight extends a trough over the state and will continue to move east clearing the state Saturday morning, followed by a new high pressure system. Another low pressure system is expected to enter from the west on Sunday, moving over central and eastern districts on Monday, followed by another ridge of high pressure which will persist until Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW005" description="Lower South East" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-30T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. High chance of showers. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northerly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the early morning. Winds northerly 15 to 25 km/h turning westerly 25 to 35 km/h in the early morning then decreasing to 15 to 20 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 14 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">No Rating</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 8 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of fog in the early morning. Medium chance of showers, most likely at night. The chance of a thunderstorm in the north at night. Winds westerly 15 to 20 km/h tending southwesterly in the late afternoon then becoming light in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds easterly 15 to 20 km/h shifting south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the day then becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-04T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-03T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers. Winds southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h turning west to northwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
